# Phase 0.5 Plan 05 — pre-commit hook chain.
#
# Three gates, in this order, each non-zero exit aborts the commit:
#   1. `lint-staged` — prettier / eslint --fix on staged files only
#   2. `check-monitored-dirs.mjs` — reject if any unstaged file lives in a
#      monitored directory (prevents the Track 0D "untracked agency routes"
#      pattern from recurring)
#   3. `check-zone-identifier.mjs` — reject `*:Zone.Identifier` Windows
#      metadata files
#
# Emergency escape: `git commit --no-verify` skips all three. Use sparingly.
# See docs/DEVELOPMENT.md for the full rationale + setup notes.

pnpm exec lint-staged
node scripts/check-monitored-dirs.mjs
node scripts/check-zone-identifier.mjs
